This product includes a port of Rebol-Easing 1.0.0
(https://github.com/Siskin-framework/Rebol-Easing), whose easing
functions come from Warren Moore's AHEasing.

src/main/java/org/jebol/domain/eval/easing/Easing.java is written from
its src/easing.c, and the command specs and TWEEN in
src/main/java/org/jebol/application/EasingExtension.java from its
src/easing-rebol-extension.r3. Rebol-Easing is released into the public
domain under the Unlicense (https://unlicense.org), and these files remain
under the Unlicense; they are not relicensed under the Apache License. They
ship: they are inside the jar. The test table and its generators under
src/testFixtures/resources/easing/ are its output and do not ship.

